01:00200E9C 6C0C            	  2075:          BGE.S   ENDS0          WHERE TO GO WHEN ALL CHARACTERS USED
01:00200E9E 5286            	  2076:          ADDQ.L  #1,D6          ANOTHER BYTE
                            	  2077: 
01:00200EA0 101A            	  2078:          MOVE.B  (A2)+,D0       GET ANOTHER BYTE OF TEXT
