01:00200ECC 300B            	  2098:          MOVE    A3,D0          SET UP TO PRINT 2 BYTE ADDRESS
01:00200ECE 61000F38        	  2099:          BSR     PNT4HX         PRINT 4 HEX CHAR ADDRESS
01:00200ED2 7C02            	  2100:          MOVEQ   #2,D6          BYTE COUNT
01:00200ED4 300B            	  2101:          MOVE.W  A3,D0          FIX UP CHECKSUM
01:00200ED6 D800            	  2102:          ADD.B   D0,D4          LOW BYTE
