                            	  3032: *-------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            	  3033: * File MDDI      MD[S] (Memory Display) Command                   06/16/82
                            	  3034: 
                            	  3035: *   ***MD***   MEMORY DISPLAY         ENTRY POINT
                            	  3036: *     FORMAT:  MD[S] <ADDRESS> [<COUNT>] [;DI]
                            	  3037: * 1.  IF 'S' USED IN COMMAND THEN IT WILL DUMP 16 LINES, (1 Screen), AND
                            	  3038: *     PROMPT-ENTER CR FOR 16 MORE LINES ETC OR ANY MACSBUG COMMAND.
                            	  3039: *
                            	  3040: 
                            	  3041: MDCMD    DS      0
