01:00201700 BDCD            	  3218:          CMP.L   A5,A6
01:00201702 6606            	  3219:          BNE.S   MMDI34
01:00201704 61000942        	  3220:          BSR     OUT1CR         NOTHING INPUT; OUTPUT LINE FEED
01:00201708 60DA            	  3221:          BRA     MMDI23
                            	  3222: 
