01:002019D2 61000516        	  3583:          BSR     CKWADR
01:002019D6 2240            	  3584:          MOVE.L  D0,A1          A1 = END ADDRESS?
01:002019D8 204B            	  3585:          MOVE.L  A3,A0          A0 = STARTING ADDRESS
01:002019DA 6100EAE0        	  3586:          BSR     P2PHY          DISPLAY TWO ADDRESSES
01:002019DE B3C8            	  3587:          CMP.L   A0,A1
01:002019E0 6500EACC        	  3588:          BCS     SYNTAX         END ADDR TOO SMALL
01:002019E4 5489            	  3589:          ADDQ.L  #2,A1          ADJUST END ADDR
01:002019E6 4E75            	  3590:          RTS
                            	  3591: 
