01:002020A2 7400            	  4506:          CLR.L   D2             CLEAR UPPER BYTES OF NULL LOOP COUNTER
01:002020A4 43F80618        	  4507:          LEA     NULLPADS,A1    FORM ADDRESS OF PADS
01:002020A8 D3C3            	  4508:          ADD.L   D3,A1          D3=0 FOR PORT1 1=PORT2
01:002020AA 1411            	  4509:          MOVE.B  (A1),D2        DEFAULT NULL PADS
