01:00202292 6714            	  4747:          BEQ.S   CTLW9          CHAR NOT READY
01:00202294 12280001        	  4748:          MOVE.B  1(A0),D1       READ CHARACTER
01:00202298 0C010017        	  4749:          CMPI.B  #CTLW,D1
