                            	  4794: ***  OUTPUT BUFFER TO TAPE  ***
01:002022F4 48E7F8C0        	  4795: TAPEOUT  MOVEM.L D0-D4/A0-A1,-(A7)  SAVE REGISTERS
01:002022F8 204D            	  4796:          MOVE.L  A5,A0          REMEMBER WHERE BUFFER STARTS
