                            	  5145: *       *  P A  *      "PRINTER ATTACH" COMMAND          *
                            	  5146: *                                                        *
                            	  5147: * IF THE "PRINTER" HAS BEEN ATTACHED, ALL CHARACTERS     *
                            	  5148: * ENTERED AND TRANSMITTED VIA THE CONSOLE WILL PRINT ON  *
                            	  5149: * THE HARD COPY PRINTER. -- TO TERMINATE, ENTER "NOPA"   *
                            	  5150: *                                                        *
                            	  5151: * THIS COMMAND MAKES USE OF THE "NO" OPTION.  THERE IS A *
