                            	     1: *************************************************************************************
                            	     2: *										    *
                            	     3: *	Enhanced BASIC for the Motorola MC680xx					    *
                            	     4: *										    *
                            	     5: *	This version is for the TS2 single board computer.		            *
                            	     6: *	Jeff Tranter (tranter@pobox.com)					    *
