                            	  5763: LAB_279B
01:0020601C 376B059C0594    	  5764: 	MOVE.w	FAC2_e(a3),FAC1_e(a3)	* copy exponent & sign
01:00206022 276B05980590    	  5765: 	MOVE.l	FAC2_m(a3),FAC1_m(a3)	* copy mantissa
01:00206028 4E75            	  5766: 	RTS
